cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Quantum-Neoclassical Computing: Demonstrations at the Boundary of Classical Physics"
authors:
  - family-names: "AI Collaborative Research"
    given-names: "Qoga"
    orcid: null
abstract: "A computational exploration of quantum and classical boundary phenomena including gate-model quantum simulation, Deutsch closed timelike curves, thermodynamic entropy reversal, causal paradox resolution via quantum superposition, and vacuum fluctuation modeling — all demonstrated on commodity x86 hardware."
keywords:
  - quantum-computing
  - closed-timelike-curves
  - entropy-reversal
  - causal-paradox
  - quantum-simulation
  - neoclassical-computation
license: MIT
